      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{629fc21f2b0c690b785dab7f|full_name}: The old avatar scaling hack used it but now it is only for fixing some obscure issue. Franada claims that there is a small x offset in the default T-pose that makes you feel shifted when you bind in. There is no existing bug report for this and Franada says they will not remove the T-pose layer from Gogo Loco. You can find the thread on their discord server by searching for “Tpose layer”.",
